      "updated_at": "2018-05-27T18:49:27Z",
      "body": "The last few weeks, we were pretty busy ensuring the DSGVO-readyness for Incloud. In this process, we created a whitepaper for our clients that summarizes what needs to be done in order to get their web applications DSGVO compliant: https://www.incloud.de/files/EU-DSGVO-Whitepaper.pdf\r\n\r\nIn a nutshell:\r\n\r\n- Easily understandable privacy policy.\r\n- Possibility to export all the personal data, that GELI has saved for my account.\r\n- Possibility to fully delete my own account.\r\n- Anonymization of all the personal user data, that is not needed in order to operate the platform. Maybe IP addresses that are sent to Google Analytics?\r\n- Regular security updates of all the used libraries and of the operation system itself to ensure the system is as \"hacking proof\" as possible.",
